        "title": "Add Gemini 3.1 Pro to free model picker",
        "summary": "Gemini 3.1 Pro (`google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview`) added to `FREEBUFF_MODELS` and prioritized in CLI selector. `base2.ts` supports model overrides, enabling 'Buffy the Gemini Evals Orchestrator'. Free mode agent model allowlists dynamically generated from `FREEBUFF_MODELS`. Database `AgentRun` gains `ancestor_run_ids` for root agent validation in completions API.",
