      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "The free assistant now lets you pick Google's new Gemini 3.1 Pro model when talking to it through the command-line tool. Gemini 3.1 Pro appears first at the top of the model list, while the previous default (GLM 5.1) moved down one spot. The system automatically updated its internal lists everywhere the old model name was hardcoded, so the new model is available in all the same actions the old one was, plus the assistant now records when one chat came from another for better tracking.",
