        "title": "Add renderui tool for interactive CLI buttons",
        "summary": "New `render_ui` tool allows agents to display interactive buttons in the Codebuff CLI. Clicking a button opens the provided `http` or `https` link via the system browser. Implemented in `cli/src/components/tools/render-ui.tsx` with theme-aware styling and state feedback. Registered in `common/src/tools/constants.ts` and `cli/src/components/tools/registry.ts`; available in non-fast base2 agent configurations.",
